# Club & Grub level file - format 2 (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md 7.11). Storm Nest: developer level of enemies-C for the
# Storm Roc (docs/expansion/PLAN.md P2.3; DESIGN.md B.5, GAMEPLAY.md 13.6): one 20 x 12 screen at the spire top, a stick
# nest of one-way cells (cols 6-13, row 8) with the Roc perched on it, a stone floor at row 10 with a 4-cell runway on
# each side; the air over the runways stays free (G46: the Roc cruises there - no drop clouds, as D9's w9_l2b draft).
# Phase 1 blows gusts across the nest, phase 2 dives, phase 3
# the lightning and the hang-glider dives (the gliders appear on the nest). The arena zone locks the camera on rows
# 0-10 (the authentic 20 x 11 view: the view's top is the arena's top in every lockable view, the floor row 10 at its
# bottom), so the Roc's G46 cruise flies 61 px over the floor with its back 55 px under the view's top (G35). The club
# routes of tests/test_enemies_roc.gd are played here; the other tests build their own room of these cells. Not part of
# any campaign (kind = test).

